    "boundary": "A row snapshot skips arithmetic only when its inspected inputs rule out both forward conclusions and both backward conclusions using explained basic endpoints. No persistent cache, new interface, bound mutation or scheduling change is retained. Same-header previous propagation fails all3 new work/semantics contracts. Targeted native tests and31 Python tests qualify this build freeze. Full native unit tests run once in the unit group of the parallel39-group acceptance; full-unit acceptance, independent implications and fair timing remain pending. Protected sets are unused and no solver superiority claim is made."
