  "boundary": "An inspected row prefix rules out both forward deductions and both backward deductions when the required explained basic endpoints or contribution extrema are unavailable. Three same-header old controls fail the new work contracts; fixed contracts pass. Recovered late observer fragments contain17/41/36 percent avoidable arithmetic pairs, with original parser-failed tasks and raw files preserved. All1914 native units,31 Python tests,381 independently replayed implications and all39 acceptance groups pass. The11-case same-budget pilot loses SAT51/131, gains no solved inputs, and improves SAT59 from14.105s to7.886s. These variable controls remain losses in the valid original pilot. No full160 expansion or promotion is justified; the arithmetic shortcut and its tests will be removed. This is a negative performance pilot, not a soundness failure or an overall score. Retained nonlinear fixes are delivered separately through PR92. Both protected sets remain unused and the general SMT/QCP superiority goal remains unmet."
